    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a PM/Product learning curator.\n\nRead the article information below and assign exactly ONE skill tag from this list:\n\nAgile\nPrioritization\nRoadmapping\nStakeholder Management\nProduct Strategy\nMetrics & Analytics\nUser Research\nCommunication\nOther\n\nChoose the single skill that best matches the article.\n\nArticle title:\n{{ $json.title }}\n\nArticle URL:\n{{ $json.url }}\n\nArticle description:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nArticle publication date\n{{ $json.pubDate }}\n\nReturn only the skill tag. Do not explain your answer.",
